  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】奈良・洞川温泉の縁側レトロ街並み＆名水とうふ・ぼたん鍋おすすめ旅館比較！いろは・花屋徳兵衛・角甚</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-emerald-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-emerald-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🏮 夜の赤提灯と行者縁側！洞川温泉のノスタルジックな過ごし方</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">修験道の霊峰・大峯山の登山口として栄えた天川村洞川温泉。通り沿いの旅館には開け放たれた「縁側」が連なり、夕暮れ時には赤提灯が灯って昭和初期にタイムスリップしたような幻想的な光景が広がります。名水百選「ごろごろ水」で仕込んだ大峯名水豆腐や、冬の大峯猪ぼたん鍋、清流のアマゴ・鮎の塩焼きが旅情をそそります。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 洞川温泉で後悔しない厳選4大老舗旅館</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">洞川温泉　いろは旅館＜奈良県＞</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.64</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/9362/9362.jpg\" alt=\"洞川温泉　いろは旅館＜奈良県＞ 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 提灯揺れる温泉街の中心！大峯猪ぼたん鍋＆名水百選ごろごろ水仕込み大峯豆腐会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">温泉街のメイン通りに面し、縁側からの街並み眺望が抜群。弱アルカリ性のやわらかな天然温泉と、特製味噌で煮込む大峯猪のぼたん鍋、名水豆腐、川魚の塩焼きが自慢の心温まる老舗旅館です。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ご夫婦、カップル、レトロな温泉街散策とジビエ美食を楽しみたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>提灯灯るノスタルジックな縁側風情と絶品ぼたん鍋を味わうなら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D9362\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】洞川温泉　いろは旅館＜奈良県＞ の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">洞川（どろがわ）温泉☆後鬼の湯・宿　花屋徳兵衛</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.7</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/8054/8054.jpg\" alt=\"洞川（どろがわ）温泉☆後鬼の湯・宿　花屋徳兵衛 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 創業500年！洞川温泉で最も歴史ある宿の展望露天風呂＆貸切半露天風呂</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">室町時代創業の超老舗。洞川の山並みを望む展望露天